{"id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-composition.md","title":"Composition","display":"df-composition — Composition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-composition","aliases":["92-df-composition"],"display":"df-composition — Composition","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-composition — Composition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-composition-—-Composition-$\\mathrm{Comp}$\">df-composition — Composition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (arities)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g : \\mathbb{N}^m \\rightharpoonup \\mathbb{N}\">\\(g : \\mathbb{N}^m \\rightharpoonup \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (partial outer function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_1, \\ldots, h_m : \\mathbb{N}^k \\rightharpoonup \\mathbb{N}\">\\(h_1, \\ldots, h_m : \\mathbb{N}^k \\rightharpoonup \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (partial inner functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span> (definition-target composition operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\nD_{g,\\vec h}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\Bigm|\\ \\vec n\\in\\bigcap_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{dom}(h_i)\\land\n(h_1(\\vec n),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec n))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\\coloneqq D_{g,\\vec h},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)(\\vec n)&amp;\\coloneqq g(h_1(\\vec n),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec n))\\qquad(\\vec n\\in D_{g,\\vec h}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\nD_{g,\\vec h}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\Bigm|\\ \\vec n\\in\\bigcap_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{dom}(h_i)\\land\n(h_1(\\vec n),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec n))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\\coloneqq D_{g,\\vec h},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)(\\vec n)&amp;\\coloneqq g(h_1(\\vec n),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec n))\\qquad(\\vec n\\in D_{g,\\vec h}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(g, h_1, \\ldots, h_m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(g, h_1, \\ldots, h_m)\\)</span> : 复合运算</li>\n<li>这是严格部分复合：任一内层值或外层调用未定义时，复合值未定义</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_i\">\\(h_i\\)</span> 都是总函数，则结果也是总函数</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_i\">\\(h_i\\)</span>都是原始递归，则结果是原始递归；若它们都是部分递归，则结果是部分递归</li>\n<li>复合保持原始递归性和递归性</li>\n<li>用于构造更复杂的函数</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x) = x + 2 = S(S(x))\">\\(f(x) = x + 2 = S(S(x))\\)</span>由复合构造</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-composition-—-Composition-$\\mathrm{Comp}$","text":"df-composition — Composition $\\mathrm{Comp}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"g : \\mathbb{N}^m \\rightharpoonup \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"h_1, \\ldots, h_m : \\mathbb{N}^k \\rightharpoonup \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\nD_{g,\\vec h}&\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\Bigm|\\ \\vec n\\in\\bigcap_{i=1}^m\\operatorname{dom}(h_i)\\land\n(h_1(\\vec n),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec n))\\in\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\\coloneqq D_{g,\\vec h},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)(\\vec n)&\\coloneqq g(h_1(\\vec n),\\ldots,h_m(\\vec n))\\qquad(\\vec n\\in D_{g,\\vec h}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}(g, h_1, \\ldots, h_m)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h_i","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h_i","display":false},{"tex":"f(x) = x + 2 = S(S(x))","display":false}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[{"id":"1286ea476a66f084","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])"},{"id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (typed partial-composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])"},{"id":"bb38790ef6a3828c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])"},{"id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])"},{"id":"7dbf1cc768d38c8b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (typed composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])"},{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (typed composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-composition]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[92-df-definability.md]]\n[[92-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[92-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[92-df-encoding-completeness.md]]\n[[92-df-enumerable.md]]\n[[92-df-expressible.md]]\n[[92